{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vopLklRAom1795507088.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>六合彩金多寶今晚攪珠，首次試行「集氣加碼制」，頭獎加碼至7,300萬元。</p><p></p><p>在中環史丹利街的投注站，開門前已有近百人排隊。六合彩50周年推出「新玩法」，首度試行「集氣加碼制」，即投注額越多，獎金金額越高。今晚金多寶會加碼500萬元，估計頭獎一注獨中，獎金達7,300萬元。</p><p></p><p>有市民指，獎金「加碼」，會「重手」下注買個機會。</p><p></p><p>馮先生說：「預計買200多元，平常也是6、70元。多買少許、碰一下運氣。最好（加碼）恆常化，因為多些人買、注額也大些。」</p><p></p><p>Michael說：「（加得）當然不夠多，每人也想發達，如果中獎會繼續上班。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.540161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:37:37.364660+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:18.276734+00:00","content_hash":"cb08cb18c82afe81b0175bea9c603ddd9a1eeb39d8b875a8f116e1b20026e61e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.540161+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}